{
 "events": [
  {
   "text": "Stefan Heße became Archbishop of the Archdiocese of Hamburg.",
   "chunk": 0,
   "date_text": "26 January 2015",
   "date": "2015-01-26",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 0,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#0"
  },
  {
   "text": "Heße was born in Cologne, Germany.",
   "chunk": 1,
   "date_text": "7 August 1966",
   "date": "1966-08-07",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#1"
  },
  {
   "text": "He graduated.",
   "chunk": 1,
   "date_text": "1986",
   "date": "1986",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#1"
  },
  {
   "text": "Heße was ordained by Cardinal Joachim Meisner in the Cologne Cathedral.",
   "chunk": 2,
   "date_text": "18 June 1993",
   "date": "1993-06-18",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#2"
  },
  {
   "text": "He became pastor at St. Remigius Church in the city of Bergheim.",
   "chunk": 2,
   "date_text": "1993",
   "date": "1993",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#2"
  },
  {
   "text": "His pastorate at St. Remigius Church ended.",
   "chunk": 2,
   "date_text": "1997",
   "date": "1997",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#2"
  },
  {
   "text": "He became a lecturer at the Collegium Albertinum, a seminary in Bonn.",
   "chunk": 2,
   "date_text": "1997",
   "date": "1997",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#2"
  },
  {
   "text": "His lectureship at the Collegium Albertinum ended.",
   "chunk": 2,
   "date_text": "2003",
   "date": "2003",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#2"
  },
  {
   "text": "He received his Doctor of Theology from the Philosophical-Theological School in Vallendar.",
   "chunk": 2,
   "date_text": "2001",
   "date": "2001",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#2"
  },
  {
   "text": "He headed the Department of Pastoral Services of the Archdiocese of Cologne.",
   "chunk": 2,
   "date_text": "2003",
   "date": "2003",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#2"
  },
  {
   "text": "His heading of the Department of Pastoral Services ended.",
   "chunk": 2,
   "date_text": "2005",
   "date": "2005",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#2"
  },
  {
   "text": "He took up the additional position as the archdiocesan delegate for radio and television.",
   "chunk": 3,
   "date_text": "2003",
   "date": "2003",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#3"
  },
  {
   "text": "His post as archdiocesan delegate for radio and television ended.",
   "chunk": 3,
   "date_text": "2012",
   "date": "2012",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#3"
  },
  {
   "text": "Heße was appointed Deputy Vicar General of the Archdiocese of Cologne.",
   "chunk": 4,
   "date_text": "1 May 2006",
   "date": "2006-05-01",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#4"
  },
  {
   "text": "He became Vicar General.",
   "chunk": 4,
   "date_text": "March 16, 2012",
   "date": "2012-03-16",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#4"
  },
  {
   "text": "Cardinal Joachim Miesner, Archbishop of Cologne, resigned and Heße was elected diocesan administrator.",
   "chunk": 4,
   "date_text": "28 February 2014",
   "date": "2014-02-28",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#4"
  },
  {
   "text": "Cardinal Rainer Maria Woelki was installed as Archbishop of Cologne.",
   "chunk": 4,
   "date_text": "20 September 2014",
   "date": "2014-09-20",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#4"
  },
  {
   "text": "At the ceremony, Heße was reaffirmed as Vicar General.",
   "chunk": 4,
   "date_text": "20 September 2014",
   "date": "2014-09-20",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#4"
  },
  {
   "text": "Pope Francis appointed Heße the fourth Archbishop of Hamburg.",
   "chunk": 5,
   "date_text": "26 January 2015",
   "date": "2015-01-26",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 2,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#5"
  },
  {
   "text": "Archbishop Werner Thissen retired.",
   "chunk": 5,
   "date_text": "March 2014",
   "date": "2014-03",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 2,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#5"
  },
  {
   "text": "Heße's episcopal consecration took place.",
   "chunk": 5,
   "date_text": "14 March 2015",
   "date": "2015-03-14",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 2,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#5"
  },
  {
   "text": "The plenary elected Heße as the German bishops special envoy to the migrant crisis.",
   "chunk": 6,
   "date_text": "September 2015",
   "date": "2015-09",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 2,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#6"
  },
  {
   "text": "Heße announced he was submitting his resignation to Pope Francis.",
   "chunk": 8,
   "date_text": "18 March 2021",
   "date": "2021-03-18",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 2,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#8"
  },
  {
   "text": "The archdiocese had established an energy fund containing eight million euros.",
   "chunk": 10,
   "date_text": "2009",
   "date": "2009",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#10"
  },
  {
   "text": "Heße called for the Catholic Church to be more realistic in regard to teachings on sexual morality.",
   "chunk": 12,
   "date_text": "1 August 2015",
   "date": "2015-08-01",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#12"
  },
  {
   "text": "In an interview, Heße spoke about his views regarding marriage and families.",
   "chunk": 14,
   "date_text": "May 2015",
   "date": "2015-05",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#14"
  },
  {
   "text": "Heße stated his opinions on divorce in an interview.",
   "chunk": 16,
   "date_text": "In May 2015",
   "date": "2015-05",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 4,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#16"
  },
  {
   "text": "Heße announced that he wishes for remarried divorcees livable forms for the Churchs recognition and accompaniment.",
   "chunk": 16,
   "date_text": "On 1 August 2015",
   "date": "2015-08-01",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 4,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#16"
  },
  {
   "text": "Heße was asked in an interview if celibacy is a disincentive for young men considering the priesthood.",
   "chunk": 18,
   "date_text": "May 2015",
   "date": "2015-05",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 5,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#18"
  },
  {
   "text": "Heße commented in an interview with Norbert Vojta that silence is one of the best forms of prayer.",
   "chunk": 21,
   "date_text": "May 2015",
   "date": "2015-05",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 7,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#21"
  },
  {
   "text": "Heße defended recent reform of the Catholic Church's Labor Law.",
   "chunk": 24,
   "date_text": "1 August 2015",
   "date": "2015-08-01",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 7,
   "flags": [
    "name_not_in_page:Church's"
   ],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#24"
  },
  {
   "text": "Heße received the title Chaplain of His Holiness.",
   "chunk": 27,
   "date_text": "In 2005",
   "date": "2005",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 9,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Stefan_Heße#27"
  },
  {
   "text": "Heße received the title of Honorary Prelate.",
   "chunk": 27,
   "date_text": "in 2010",
   "date": "2010",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 9,
   "flags": [],
